WEBVTT

00:02.900 --> 00:05.190
You, dear. Listen closely.

00:05.480 --> 00:10.200
What you need to eradicate are the ones
who are trying to plunder from us.

00:10.860 --> 00:13.570
You, dear. That's why you shall fight.

00:13.570 --> 00:17.410
So that you can take your 
mother back someday.

00:17.700 --> 00:19.250
You filthy spellcaster!

00:29.170 --> 00:31.470
Oh...

00:32.010 --> 00:35.970
You're missing quite 
a lot deep down there.

00:38.640 --> 00:41.230
Let me tell you something interesting.

00:43.770 --> 00:48.990
Those spellcasters that were repeatedly
calling you guys "You, dear"...

00:48.990 --> 00:50.860
They all died, okay?

01:01.500 --> 01:03.710
If you still want to keep living...

01:04.330 --> 01:05.670
come with me.

01:08.000 --> 01:10.880
Oh, and... about your mother.

01:11.300 --> 01:16.550
She's long since died in 
a country called Japan.

01:21.140 --> 01:22.980
Let me tell you once again.

01:23.600 --> 01:26.440
This operation is to recreate 
a Magecraft ritual...

01:26.440 --> 01:29.400
that was once held in the Far East.

01:30.110 --> 01:35.620
We fished up six Masters and their Servants
using a fake Holy Grail War as the lure.

01:36.410 --> 01:39.220
We will use them as 
catalysts to officially

01:39.220 --> 01:41.830
summon seven Servants, and the real...

01:42.250 --> 01:45.540
the True Holy Grail War will commence.

01:46.420 --> 01:49.800
As a Master of the True Holy Grail War...

01:49.800 --> 01:52.010
I will have you summon a Servant.

01:52.630 --> 01:54.340
If the summon succeeds—

01:54.340 --> 01:57.220
You don't have to report 
to me what showed up!

01:57.220 --> 02:00.060
You can do whatever you want
after it's summoned, too!

02:00.060 --> 02:03.310
If anything, you can even consider
coming after my life!

02:03.310 --> 02:05.980
Please make sure to report to me.

02:06.350 --> 02:10.440
And this has nothing to 
do with the job, but...

02:11.070 --> 02:13.900
The wish granter that can make
any wish come true...

02:14.240 --> 02:17.490
What will you wish upon the Holy Grail?

02:17.950 --> 02:19.370
I don't have any wishes.

02:19.780 --> 02:22.830
I don't have a god to believe in
or a homeland to return to.

02:23.660 --> 02:28.000
All I desire are meals 
and good sleep each day.

04:01.760 --> 04:03.050
I didn't expect the favorite...

04:03.680 --> 04:07.020
that you kept talking about 
to be a boy like him.

04:07.350 --> 04:10.750
Oh, right. He looks like 
a boy because they fiddled

04:10.750 --> 04:12.980
with his body too much when he was young.

04:13.310 --> 04:16.440
He probably can't live that long a life.

04:17.400 --> 04:20.110
Though, he's not the type
to worry about stuff like that.

04:20.110 --> 04:24.490
Is that the reason why you didn't prepare
a catalyst for him?

04:24.490 --> 04:26.490
I had a lightbulb moment.

04:26.950 --> 04:31.500
If I made a fake Holy Grail choose
a Servant for someone who has nothing...

04:32.130 --> 04:33.250
what exactly...

04:33.250 --> 04:36.300
would be drawn to it?

04:45.560 --> 04:47.600
<i>For the elements, silver and iron.</i>

04:47.930 --> 04:50.850
<i>For the foundation, stone
and the Archduke of Contracts.</i>

04:51.140 --> 04:53.480
<i>That's why I want you,
who doesn't have anything!</i>

04:53.940 --> 04:57.940
<i>No desires for the world,
no intention of leaving anything behind!</i>

04:58.320 --> 05:02.610
<i>With someone like you,
the Holy Grail can enter a plain state.</i>

05:03.160 --> 05:04.490
<i>Just what will...</i>

05:04.910 --> 05:06.700
<i>come to you?</i>

05:12.330 --> 05:14.250
<i>Come forth from the circle of binding...</i>

05:14.630 --> 05:16.540
<i>Guardian of the Scales!</i>

05:33.350 --> 05:36.310
So, you're a Master of the Holy Grail War?

05:36.730 --> 05:37.820
Hah!

05:37.820 --> 05:39.780
How this face lacks ambition.

05:40.650 --> 05:44.240
I am indeed the Master who summoned you.

05:44.950 --> 05:47.200
You can call me "Captain."

05:47.530 --> 05:50.910
But that will soon become meaningless.

05:51.450 --> 05:53.160
Who exactly are you?

05:54.620 --> 05:58.130
My boy, you have a misunderstanding.

05:58.590 --> 05:59.960
We were not...

05:59.960 --> 06:02.260
summoned by you.

06:02.260 --> 06:03.010
Who are you?

06:03.340 --> 06:08.050
We are nothing more than shadows
of the Heroic Spirit you summoned.

06:08.430 --> 06:11.220
We are not Heroic Spirits.

06:11.520 --> 06:14.230
You're outta luck, man.

06:14.230 --> 06:16.440
You can't escape now.

06:16.850 --> 06:20.610
You have summoned a hardship
that has no way out.

06:20.980 --> 06:22.240
However...

06:22.240 --> 06:24.780
we have high hopes for you.

06:25.490 --> 06:29.030
That you will become a Lancer
that pierces through all.

06:29.370 --> 06:31.080
What do you mean?

06:31.080 --> 06:33.750
Are you lot not the Lancer?

06:33.750 --> 06:36.060
If Fuyuki's system was used as is,

06:36.060 --> 06:39.590
Lancer would have been the 
one rightfully summoned.

06:40.340 --> 06:41.840
Then, what in the world...

06:43.590 --> 06:45.340
Let's see.

06:45.340 --> 06:51.060
A guardian whose job is to always look
down on us from a high place...

06:53.020 --> 06:56.850
I guess you could say... "Watcher."

07:09.740 --> 07:11.120
Hurry up already!

07:11.120 --> 07:13.410
Now, whatcha gonna do?

07:18.080 --> 07:19.830
Mr. Cordelion?

07:19.830 --> 07:21.170
Bazdilot!

07:21.170 --> 07:23.590
What are you doing
to a member of the family?

07:26.090 --> 07:27.010
A fly.

07:28.050 --> 07:28.840
Wait—

07:32.720 --> 07:36.600
If you thought you could infiltrate
with a disguise like that...

07:36.890 --> 07:40.440
that's a great insult to Mr. Scradio.

07:41.480 --> 07:43.270
No way! Spies?

07:43.270 --> 07:45.150
Come to the basement
once you're done cleaning up.

07:46.030 --> 07:49.360
I received a catalyst from the States.

07:50.110 --> 07:52.330
I will summon a Servant.

07:53.410 --> 07:55.410
Bazdilot Cordelion.

07:55.700 --> 07:59.120
His public face is the president
of an industrial waste disposal company.

07:59.580 --> 08:01.580
His hidden side is a high-ranking member

08:01.580 --> 08:03.880
of the Scradio Family, 
a huge mafia group...

08:03.880 --> 08:05.710
that is very close
to a portion of the government.

08:06.550 --> 08:10.380
There are over 125 murders
that he is suspected of involvement.

08:10.890 --> 08:12.280
During his first incarceration,

08:12.280 --> 08:16.720
three wardens and 26 inmates
went missing in six months.

08:17.270 --> 08:20.940
He painted the entire penitentiary
into allies of the Scradio Family.

08:21.600 --> 08:23.730
I am still against it.

08:23.730 --> 08:26.860
Taking someone
with so many enemies out of jail...

08:26.860 --> 08:29.280
to weave him into the Holy Grail War.

08:29.280 --> 08:34.490
You say that, but all the Masters I called
are kinda similar, you know!

08:35.030 --> 08:37.870
The Masters can all be controlled
however we wish.

08:37.870 --> 08:38.660
But...

08:39.160 --> 08:42.670
you and Bazdilot Cordelion 
are a different story.

08:43.040 --> 08:45.290
Hey, what do you think will happen?

08:47.000 --> 08:53.470
I mean, he's trying to summon
the great virtuous, unyielding hero...

08:54.430 --> 08:56.430
Heracles!

09:00.940 --> 09:01.850
Are you the one...

09:02.690 --> 09:06.320
that will become my master
and present me a labor?

09:06.610 --> 09:10.280
The one who decides that 
isn't me. That's you.

09:10.950 --> 09:14.490
And I shall ask you, as well.

09:15.030 --> 09:16.740
O hero of Greece.

09:16.740 --> 09:20.200
Can you take the life of a young child
if it meant winning the war?

09:23.620 --> 09:25.040
Are you...

09:25.040 --> 09:26.460
testing me?

09:27.250 --> 09:29.710
If you speak of such
knowing my background...

09:30.210 --> 09:33.800
I will deem those words
as something you risk your life for.

09:33.800 --> 09:35.220
Of course.

09:35.220 --> 09:36.430
I have already...

09:36.850 --> 09:39.310
thrown my life away long ago.

09:40.020 --> 09:41.600
How facile.

09:42.020 --> 09:45.440
Restraints from Command Spells
are meaningless to me.

09:46.110 --> 09:48.020
I order you with a Command Spell.

09:48.730 --> 09:50.490
Drop your facade.

09:52.190 --> 09:53.530
Bastard!

09:53.530 --> 09:55.030
What did you...

09:55.030 --> 09:57.700
I don't need a hero.

09:57.700 --> 10:02.120
I need human obsession that uses
any means necessary to meet an objective.

10:02.870 --> 10:04.330
Impossible!

10:04.710 --> 10:08.790
This is not a level of Magical Energy
that someone of this era can harbor!

10:09.210 --> 10:11.510
I further order you with 
another Command Spell.

10:12.010 --> 10:15.640
Remember all the humans you have observed.

10:17.510 --> 10:18.720
<i>Stay away from me, monster!</i>

10:18.720 --> 10:22.220
<i>Only when you're together with me,
you won't be a monster.</i>

10:20.010 --> 10:21.930
<i>Don't detest your own blood.</i>

10:22.220 --> 10:23.520
<i>Father!</i>

10:27.020 --> 10:29.150
Wh-What's going on?

10:29.400 --> 10:30.860
I further command you.

10:33.030 --> 10:35.450
<i>This Mage is dangerous!</i>

10:36.320 --> 10:37.280
<i>I...</i>

10:37.870 --> 10:39.530
<i>must stop him!</i>

10:39.950 --> 10:43.080
Accept the true nature of humans.

10:45.670 --> 10:47.710
Was it really all right?

10:48.210 --> 10:52.170
I mean, to hand him that thing
you brought here from Fuyuki.

10:52.460 --> 10:54.170
It's fine, it's fine!

10:54.170 --> 10:55.680
I mean...

10:56.470 --> 10:59.100
I didn't want to keep touching...

10:59.100 --> 11:01.560
that uncute and nasty <i>mud</i>!

11:30.420 --> 11:33.880
How does it feel
to get rid of what is unnecessary?

11:37.970 --> 11:39.720
Why do you hide your face?

11:40.470 --> 11:42.220
Admonition.

11:42.220 --> 11:46.390
So that the sins of man
never reach my eyes again.

11:52.400 --> 11:53.360
I ask you.

11:54.280 --> 11:57.190
Are you my Servant?

11:58.570 --> 12:00.820
My name is Alcides.

12:01.450 --> 12:03.870
I will have my vengeance 
against the gods...

12:03.870 --> 12:06.080
and using the power of the Holy Grail...

12:06.450 --> 12:08.040
I will rid myself...

12:08.580 --> 12:11.040
of my posthumous name!

12:12.170 --> 12:14.170
Though it was due to an interference...

12:14.670 --> 12:17.630
I didn't think you'd let those
affiliated with the gods escape.

12:18.630 --> 12:19.840
Ridiculous.

12:20.260 --> 12:23.930
I am simply using you for my vengeance.

12:24.470 --> 12:27.890
But tell me. What is the source
of your Magical Energy?

12:28.680 --> 12:32.440
Even after such a fierce battle,
I did not feel it ever flicker.

12:32.860 --> 12:36.070
That is not the Magical Energy level
of an ordinary Mage.

12:36.610 --> 12:38.030
It's quite simple.

12:39.650 --> 12:41.490
I am using batteries.

12:42.530 --> 12:43.410
In the past...

12:43.950 --> 12:46.900
a Mage named Atrum Galliasta created

12:46.900 --> 12:51.460
a system that efficiently
creates Magical Energy.

12:51.460 --> 12:53.380
We pilfered it, improved it...

12:53.380 --> 12:55.840
and built upon it.

12:56.380 --> 12:58.550
A Magical Energy forge...

12:58.880 --> 13:00.470
that runs on human lives, huh?

13:01.880 --> 13:05.030
With this much, I'll 
have no issues fighting

13:05.030 --> 13:08.020
at full throttle for about half a day.

13:08.390 --> 13:10.180
Half a day with this much?

13:10.520 --> 13:11.310
Then...

13:11.940 --> 13:15.270
you should be able to continue fighting
with all you've got for several months.

13:15.860 --> 13:20.740
How many humans have you sacrificed
to this contraption until now?

13:21.110 --> 13:22.070
Oh...

13:22.700 --> 13:26.280
just 24,976 people.

13:26.660 --> 13:29.160
Surprising you were able 
to keep it a secret.

13:29.160 --> 13:30.250
Of course.

13:30.710 --> 13:35.840
It is all thanks to my lord
Galvarosso Scradio's connections.

13:36.380 --> 13:40.300
The bigger the Scradio Family gets,
the more enemies we have.

13:40.590 --> 13:41.970
If we have to eradicate them anyway...

13:42.300 --> 13:44.890
we should make good use of them.

13:45.930 --> 13:49.430
I appreciate that you 
stopped their squabbles...

13:49.850 --> 13:52.940
but we'll be in trouble
if you don't hold your reins properly.

13:53.270 --> 13:56.980
<i>Whaaat? Are the States 
threatening me right now?</i>

13:56.980 --> 13:59.280
<i>Am I going to be murdered?</i>

13:59.280 --> 14:04.030
I hear you have been erased by the Agency
twice or so in the past.

14:04.030 --> 14:06.530
<i>Yep! It hurt quite a bit, you know!</i>

14:06.870 --> 14:09.080
I cannot understand it.

14:09.080 --> 14:11.950
Why the government decided
to join forces with you

14:11.950 --> 14:14.330
even if it has been several decades...

14:14.330 --> 14:17.380
or you, who has the nerve
to join forces with a government...

14:17.380 --> 14:19.000
that tried to eradicate 
your very existence.

14:19.000 --> 14:24.300
<i>Having my physical body killed
is not something I feel despair over.</i>

14:24.300 --> 14:27.680
<i>Well, there are many people
who have murdered me,</i>

14:27.680 --> 14:29.720
<i>but... I can easily count 
the number of those</i>

14:29.720 --> 14:31.890
<i>that brought me to my knees with an "Oof!"</i>

14:32.270 --> 14:34.910
<i>Let's see. The old man Kischur,</i>

14:34.910 --> 14:38.860
<i>the hedonistic Saint Germain
and most of all...</i>

14:39.230 --> 14:41.150
<i>Scar Red!</i>

14:41.150 --> 14:43.320
She'll kill you if you 
say that to her face.

14:43.690 --> 14:45.450
<i>She did kill me!</i>

14:45.450 --> 14:47.910
<i>That's how I ended up in my current body.</i>

14:48.620 --> 14:51.540
Is that why you became 
interested in eternal youth?

14:52.120 --> 14:53.250
<i>Yep, yep!</i>

14:53.250 --> 14:56.670
<i>"Drag down the Third Magic
to Magecraft levels"...</i>

14:56.670 --> 14:59.500
<i>was your ultimate objective, right?</i>

14:59.960 --> 15:01.590
Is it not for you?

15:02.050 --> 15:04.670
<i>For me, that's only a checkpoint.</i>

15:05.260 --> 15:09.140
<i>It's better if there is no magic
that defines the limitations of humans.</i>

15:09.140 --> 15:11.010
<i>That's what I believe in...</i>

15:11.010 --> 15:13.430
<i>and I believe that the 
true nature of humans...</i>

15:13.720 --> 15:16.310
<i>is the foolishness to face that threshold!</i>

15:16.690 --> 15:19.940
<i>Because the world is 
more amusing that way!</i>

15:20.360 --> 15:23.530
I have no intention
of putting up with your hedonism.

15:23.530 --> 15:27.410
If necessary, I will forcefully have you
exit the stage.

15:27.950 --> 15:29.570
<i>What are you talking about?</i>

15:29.570 --> 15:32.580
<i>You and I are enemies 
in the Holy Grail War.</i>

15:32.580 --> 15:34.500
<i>You shouldn't forget about that, okay?</i>

15:37.080 --> 15:38.460
I know that.

15:38.870 --> 15:42.710
I have never once thought
that you were on our side.

15:43.000 --> 15:44.920
Jeez!

15:45.210 --> 15:49.550
Faldeus should enjoy the war more.

15:51.180 --> 15:54.470
We have so many actors
that shine on the stage after all!

15:54.890 --> 15:56.680
Hey, don't you think so?

15:57.690 --> 16:02.770
Isn't this where you welcome me
with a "Welcome home, master!"?

16:03.360 --> 16:06.740
I did some work immediately
after being summoned, you know.

16:07.110 --> 16:07.990
But...

16:07.990 --> 16:10.160
I'm the master here!

16:10.160 --> 16:12.880
And that was nothing 
more than a performance

16:12.880 --> 16:15.290
to make the States feel relieved.

16:15.620 --> 16:19.790
But still, it wasn't all 
that bad a show, right?

16:20.120 --> 16:22.460
Yep! I gotta hand it to me!

16:22.460 --> 16:25.050
Oh, but I wanted to see it in person...

16:25.050 --> 16:27.760
the angry face of the King of Heroes!

16:38.180 --> 16:41.600
Now, now, this is just the beginning, me!

16:41.940 --> 16:42.860
Yep!

16:42.860 --> 16:45.230
Let's put our souls on the line

16:45.230 --> 16:48.150
and win this Holy Grail War
fair and square, me!

16:48.440 --> 16:50.530
I, François Prelati...

16:48.740 --> 16:50.530
I, Francesca Prelati...

16:50.530 --> 16:52.870
- in pure, righteous glory...
- in pure, righteous glory...

16:53.160 --> 16:54.470
- ...swear to win and acquire
-  ...swear to win and acquire

16:54.470 --> 16:55.830
-  the great Holy Grail!
-  the great Holy Grail!

17:02.500 --> 17:03.790
- Just kidding!
- Just kidding!

17:11.510 --> 17:16.560
In other words, you lot can objectively
observe the Holy Grail War?

17:16.560 --> 17:21.520
To be precise, not us,
but the one you summoned.

17:22.020 --> 17:23.400
I don't get it.

17:23.400 --> 17:26.020
Is this what you call an "Extra Class"?

17:26.020 --> 17:28.990
And... what do you mean
I'm going to become Lancer?

17:29.650 --> 17:31.280
I got some sleep and thought 
it over once again,

17:31.280 --> 17:32.980
but it's not making sense to me.

17:32.980 --> 17:36.640
I think you're quite something 
to be able to sleep

17:36.640 --> 17:38.450
and even eat in this condition.

17:38.830 --> 17:42.540
Sleep and meals are more 
important than anything.

17:44.790 --> 17:47.550
We are slightly different
from those Extra Class folks.

17:48.090 --> 17:49.380
Didn't I tell you?

17:49.380 --> 17:51.630
You're the one who will become Lancer.

17:51.630 --> 17:55.010
Watcher is the barrier and watchtower
for that to happen.

17:55.600 --> 17:59.100
Isn't it absurd to say
that a human will become Lancer?

17:59.100 --> 18:01.980
What is absurd is this 
Holy Grail War itself.

18:02.690 --> 18:05.230
It has derailed all too far.

18:05.610 --> 18:09.650
Those that normally would not be summoned
are calling for each other...

18:10.070 --> 18:12.990
and more will be drawn over to this land.

18:19.240 --> 18:23.040
<i>Those parents have not shown up
for two days now.</i>

18:24.420 --> 18:25.830
Tsubaki...

18:25.830 --> 18:27.210
It's all right.

18:27.750 --> 18:30.670
I will never abandon you.

18:32.340 --> 18:34.510
Is this a tattoo?

18:34.970 --> 18:36.970
Was this here before?

18:45.140 --> 18:48.560
Did you pull this bird out, as well?

18:50.610 --> 18:53.610
Thank you! I love animals!

18:54.200 --> 18:58.160
Love!

19:13.300 --> 19:15.300
You know, Mr. Black...

19:16.800 --> 19:21.350
nobody will disappear anymore, right?

19:23.600 --> 19:27.190
Nobody will disappear anymore, right?

19:29.400 --> 19:31.150
Oh, yes! I'm sorry!

19:31.730 --> 19:34.320
Yes. Thank you so much.

19:34.320 --> 19:35.860
Goodbye.

19:38.200 --> 19:42.580
Professor wasted two hours of his time
because of me.

19:42.580 --> 19:45.960
I see the reason why you admire
your mentor so much.

19:45.960 --> 19:48.420
He is a magnificent 
instructor of Magecraft.

19:49.290 --> 19:52.560
Taking into account the tale that 
he survived a Holy Grail War,

19:52.560 --> 19:55.130
he must also be top-notch as a Mage.

19:55.460 --> 20:00.510
Of course! Professor has solved
all sorts of cases for the Clock Tower—

20:02.930 --> 20:04.970
What's wrong, Master?

20:05.470 --> 20:08.060
The fog is rather thick.

20:08.350 --> 20:11.020
What are you talking about?
There isn't any fog anywhere—

20:11.020 --> 20:14.730
Mr. Berserker, we might 
be in a bit of trouble.

20:15.190 --> 20:19.660
This fog... has at least
swallowed up the entire city.

20:21.240 --> 20:23.120
What will happen to me now?

20:23.490 --> 20:24.480
From hereon out,

20:24.480 --> 20:28.660
an assortment of difficulties you may
call "trials" will stand in your way.

20:28.660 --> 20:32.420
By overcoming them,
you will slowly become someone.

20:32.920 --> 20:35.130
I am a mere soldier with no name.

20:35.760 --> 20:39.840
I will not amount to "a somebody,"
even to death.

20:40.180 --> 20:41.600
We'll see about that.

20:41.600 --> 20:44.180
That just means that you 
can become anything.

20:44.810 --> 20:47.270
Escape the jaws of death, young man.

20:47.270 --> 20:49.640
Rage against God.

20:49.640 --> 20:51.480
Never submit.

20:51.980 --> 20:56.440
Beyond all that
is where the proof of your life will be.

20:56.940 --> 20:57.650
See...

20:58.030 --> 21:00.610
your first trial has already arrived.

21:11.830 --> 21:15.710
Are you a Mage seeking the Holy Grail?

21:16.170 --> 21:16.960
Are you...

21:17.420 --> 21:19.840
a Servant?

21:20.380 --> 21:22.260
Answer my question.

21:22.680 --> 21:25.260
Hold on. I have no hostile intent.

21:25.640 --> 21:28.390
Can you allow me
to negotiate with your Master?

21:29.480 --> 21:30.430
Jump.

21:30.430 --> 21:32.020
You have some hair coming your way.

21:32.020 --> 21:33.900
<i>Zabaniya.</i>

21:48.580 --> 21:50.450
That's not a Master.

21:50.450 --> 21:54.250
That's a poor little girl
who got roped into the Holy Grail War.

21:55.790 --> 21:56.790
Get away!

21:56.790 --> 21:58.050
If you stay here...

22:08.560 --> 22:10.060
EPISODE 5
